# q-row-hover (h8-points-row): the pointer resting on the plane: Q
# "follows your pointer" with f(x) = y at the quantized x. Runs after
# h8-plane merges (its Q source); until then judged from a scratch script
# that sets q_x. Plane centre at 1440x900 is about 900 450.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
move 900 450
wait 500
shot q-row-hover
